  <p id="c-liangshu-022-xiaofan-si:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-liangshu-022-xiaofan-si:p001:m0000" ref="qvt_eq1_lcf_AA">恢</persName>性通恕，輕財好施，凡歷四州，所得俸祿隨而散之。在荊州，常從容問賓僚曰：「中山好酒，趙王好吏，二者孰愈？」衆未有對者。顧謂長史蕭琛曰：「漢時王侯，籓屏而已，視事親民，自有其職。中山聽樂，可得任性；彭祖代吏，近於侵官。今之王侯，不守籓國，當佐天子臨民，清白其優乎！」坐賓咸服。世子<persName id="c-liangshu-022-xiaofan-si:p001:m0139" ref="qvt_eq1_lcf_AAB">範</persName>嗣。</p>
  <p id="c-liangshu-022-xiaofan-si:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">及<persName id="c-liangshu-022-xiaofan-si:p002:m0001" ref="5d1_8jg_amy">景</persName>圍京邑，<persName id="c-liangshu-022-xiaofan-si:p002:m0006" ref="qvt_eq1_lcf_AAB">範</persName>遣世子<persName id="c-liangshu-022-xiaofan-si:p002:m0010" ref="qvt_eq1_lcf_AABA">嗣</persName>與<persName id="c-liangshu-022-xiaofan-si:p002:m0012" ref="4kt_0ar_aqo_AAA">裴之高</persName>等入援，</p>
</text>
